# Dexie / IndexedDB (Local-First)

- **Single entry point:** Keep persistence and schema consolidated in `@src/services/databaseService.ts`; no second parallel Dexie instance without review.
- **Migrations:** Explicit version bumps and upgrade transactions; document defaults for new fields; mention breaking changes in the CHANGELOG.
- **Tests:** Use `fake-indexeddb` / the setup in `@src/test/setup.ts`; no live network/IndexedDB dependency in unit tests.
- **Performance:** Indexes only where needed; batch large writes where the schema allows it.

See `@src/services/databaseService.ts`, `@vitest.config.ts` (coverage scope).
